Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,[
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:41.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:02:42.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Leo/need...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:04:20.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Welcome to ProSeka AfterTalk: "Stars Hidden in the Blue Night Sky" edition!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:28.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm Karin Isobe, the voice of Saki Tenma from Leo/need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:37.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,Tonight's AfterTalk is a program where we look back on the event
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:42.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,while reading your messages for "Stars Hidden in the Blue Night Sky."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:50.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,The script asks, "Did everyone enjoy the story?" but I wonder if "enjoy" is the right word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:05:00.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,This story was quite heavy. I even mentioned it on X,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:11.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,but I really felt how important this story would be for Saki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:15.10,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure it really tugged at your heartstrings too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:21.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,I have so many thoughts and feelings about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:26.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,but I'd like to look back on everything together with the messages you sent in.
Comment: 0,0:10:54.64,0:11:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Fan Letter Corner ===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:11:03.28,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,AfterTalk has had a bit of a renewal, and we've received messages for the show in advance via the official ProSeka Discord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:06.08,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you so much to everyone for all the messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:11.50,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,I'll be introducing some of the messages we received during the program,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:12.48,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,so please look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:21.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Also, please post your thoughts on the event and this broadcast using the hashtag #ProSekaAfterTalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:23.70,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm also keeping an eye on the YouTube chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:26.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's saying "kon-needo."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:27.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:36.04,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Someone said they got anxious and cried during the last scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.95,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I should have sent in a message," they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:39.92,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,You should have!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:41.87,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Please do send them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:47.76,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Someone else wrote that this was a turning point for Saki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:49.66,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone, keep saying "kon-needo."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:50.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.80,0:11:59.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,I have the YouTube chat right here in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:03.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,so I can hear all your voices, which is the best part of AfterTalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:08.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,I want to share all these feelings and things we're curious about
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:12.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,with everyone as we go through the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:15.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,I hope you'll enjoy the program with me.
Comment: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Story Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.24,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,All right then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:26.52,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk about the story for the event "Stars Hidden in the Night Sky."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:33.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,I saw some comments about Saki earlier, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:35.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,How did you all like the story this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:39.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,It really tugged at my heartstrings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:45.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,For Leo/need... and for the group as a whole,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:53.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,it felt like the kind of ending that makes you wonder what's going to happen to Saki-chan next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:13:00.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,First, I'd like to read some of the messages we received about the story and look back on it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.60,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,This message is from Mirin-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:06.32,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:07.88,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Are you watching right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:10.84,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Yeah, the story was pretty heavy, wasn't it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:12.96,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,From "Mr Uneasy": "What's up?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:22.12,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I see some people saying was an amazing story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:25.72,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Yeah, that ending though...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:27.08,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:30.88,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Let's start by reading Mirin-san's message.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:33.48,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Isobe-san, kon-needo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:34.44,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:41.20,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I have so much to say about this event, but first, let me just say:"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.96,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Saki!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:45.04,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:48.20,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Wasn't that story just way too sad?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:52.72,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Saki usually wears her heart on her sleeve and isn't afraid to just sayr what she's thinking,"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:55.58,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"but when it comes to the most important things, she's scared to speak her mind."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:56.71,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"{\i1}That's a problem{\i0}!"
Comment: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:57.25,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:14:02.84,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Between the last Leo/need event and how unsettling things have been lately, I'm really worried."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.52,0:14:09.34,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'll wish upon a shooting star that the hearts of everyone in Leo/need will clear up as soon as possible."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:11.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for writing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:14.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:16.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.12,0:14:23.65,Default,host,0,0,0,,when a girl who's usually so cheerful is suddenly starts looking down like that.
Comment: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a betterr word for "gap"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:25.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,Like, I wouldn't fully call it a "gap", but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:30.30,Default,host,0,0,0,,Even in their everyday lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:37.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,seeing that kind of gap in someone makes you worry about them more than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:40.62,Default,host,0,0,0,,And in this event, it was just like you wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:43.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,Usually, Saki-chan's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:49.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,more the type to go full steam ahead, like "Let's do this!" or "Let's go!",
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:53.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,and the rest of Leo/need is would go, "Good grief."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:57.73,Default,host,0,0,0,,Especially Shiho-chan, who always goes "Geez."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:15:00.82,Default,host,0,0,0,,But in the end everyone still goes along with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:03.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,She really brightens things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:07.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,You can usually count on Saki to be super bright like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:16.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,but at the very end of this story, her lingering feelings started to surface...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:21.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,I don't know what happens after this myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:30.17,Default,host,0,0,0,,but in this story, she makes the choice not to say anything for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:31.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,And so I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:34.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,I don't know "gap" is the right word for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:41.07,Default,host,0,0,0,,but seeing Saki-chan make this choice when she's normally so earnest...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:41.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:48.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,it was quite surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:53.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,But it also shows just how much she cares about everyone in Leo/need.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:57.65,Default,host,0,0,0,,Of course we've seen examples of her friends' passion in past stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.65,0:16:04.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,like Shiho-chan's determination toward their dream of going professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:14.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,Her treasuring all their feelings is what led Saki-chan to make this decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:16.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,I really feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:23.03,Default,host,0,0,0,,I just want to watch over Saki-chan as a fan myself.
Comment: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:28.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,But as the one delivering the lines as Saki...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:35.18,Default,host,0,0,0,,since I'm also in this industry myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:40.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,I felt like I could empathize with Saki-chan's feelings in a lot of different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:49.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Especially speaking as a performer too, I could understand the way Saki-chan felt in this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:55.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think it's also because I've been with Saki-chan for a long time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:17:00.47,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because I understand those various emotions, it was really painful for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:04.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'd like to introduce another message.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:07.70,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Sakaguchi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:09.22,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's right, these three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:15.28,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Ending the year like this is way too rough!" they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:18.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thanks for all the comments, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:28.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,And thinking more like pros now that they've finished their solo show, maybe it's because they've grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:36.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's true, everyone has shown so much growth throughout this journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:43.67,Default,host,0,0,0,,Their ways of thinking change, and their emotions move in different ways than before, so it's only natural, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:45.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,I suppose that's just part of growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:49.36,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Now, let me read the message from Sakaguchi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:50.64,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Isobe-san, kon-needo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:51.92,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:59.70,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"This event story had many scenes of Saki-chan's time in the hospital and her inner conflicts,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:02.96,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,and watching it really made my heart ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:13.35,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Especially at the end of Episode 8, when Saki-chan resolved never to reveal her feelings just so she could stay with everyone,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.35,0:18:15.63,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I was so overwhelmed that I burst into tears."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:17.64,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:26.16,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"So, I have a question. Was there anything you kept in mind when performing the painful scenes in Episodes 4 and 8?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:29.72,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'd also like to know what kind of mindset you had during the recording."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:34.50,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Isobe-san, you did post a little bit on X about the recording session,
Comment: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:37.00,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"but I'm interested if you have anything more to share."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:42.06,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Your performance made me feel once again how glad I am that Isobe-san is the one playing Saki-chan."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.06,0:18:43.20,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:44.29,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I love the way that you play Saki-chan."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:47.16,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It's still pretty cold, so please take care of yourself."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:50.86,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for such a polite and thoughtful message.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:53.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:58.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,First of all, hearing you say that makes me so incredibly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:03.57,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:13.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Like I mentioned a bit earlier, this time I felt close to Saki-chan's feelings from many different angles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:18.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,There was Saki's own perspective, and then there were the feelings I had
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:23.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,when I first read the script myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.96,0:19:30.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,My own perspective as a professional actress also played a part.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:38.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,All those things overlapped, and as you wrote, episodes 4 and 8 were truly painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:43.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,During the recording session... how should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:55.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,I had to try my best to stay calm, if that's the right way to say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:20:02.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Even with all those different thoughts swirling around,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:07.45,Default,host,0,0,0,,I tried to keep Saki-chan's core as my focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:10.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,—And so even thought a lot was going through my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:17.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,This listener did ask about what I had in mind for the recording,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.56,0:20:24.50,Default,host,0,0,0,,and while my own feelings were coming through for a lot of different reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:32.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,if I let that happen too much, it would just be too painful. I felt like my emotions would just completely take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:38.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,When it comes to the actual recording session,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:46.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,what matters most is how Saki-chan sees this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:47.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,As an actress, that's what I believe is most important.
Comment: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:52.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,So, I really wanted to keep a core focus on how Saki-chan would feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:54.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,but keeping up her mindset in the moment is pretty—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:21:02.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,my own emotions definitely come through, but right now, I'm trying my hardest understand Saki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:06.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,and express her as best as I can when I go into recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:15.46,Default,host,0,0,0,,So somehow I was able to keep reminding myself during the session that I mustn't forget to keep a level head and stay grounded in the character.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:17.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,But that's just how much it affected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:23.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because of the time I've spent walking alongside Saki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:29.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,and everything we've been through with Leo/need to get to this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.88,0:21:37.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,it's like, when you've known someone this long, even if you don't do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:40.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,those emotions just start overflowing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:48.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think it's the same for all of you, since you're all mentioning how much it hurt to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:55.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's been supporting Leo/need so much in their journey and understand them so well,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.44,0:22:02.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,so I think you end up empathizing with their individual feelings like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:07.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,I felt the same way. The recording was honestly really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:14.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk more about that later, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:16.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,Actually, let's save the extra details for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:28.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Next, I'd like to introduce scene that I personally want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:34.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,I've chosen a scene from Episode 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:41.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,The thing is, I tend to get really serious while watching Episode 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:49.22,Default,host,0,0,0,,Since there are many painful scenes to look back on, and I usually talk a lot during the clips,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:59.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,I thought it might be hard to talk then, so I'll explain why I chose this scene first. How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:00.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Are you all keeping up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:02.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,I feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:04.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,I feel like I've just been talking non-stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.28,0:23:06.31,Default,host,0,0,0,,Are we doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:16.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,"It's because of Saki's usual energy that the negative emotions stand out so much."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:21.46,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's why I tried to be very deliberate in my tone to not let all my personal emotions come through.
Comment: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.59,Default,host,0,0,0,,We're talking about Saki's recording session.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:32.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,It was so painful that she felt she couldn't get quite as fired up as the others for the one-man live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:33.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:35.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:38.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:46.37,Default,host,0,0,0,,Celebrating their live's success supposed to be a happy thing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.54,0:23:53.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,for us watching over them, seeing Saki get those feelings was just heartbreaking.
Comment: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Add Leo/need breakup I am inevitable meme
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:24:00.26,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's unavoidable, given everyone's different feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.26,0:24:06.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki-chan's had her own stance,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.16,0:24:09.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,but maybe these feelings coming out more because they're pros now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.72,0:24:11.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.88,0:24:14.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,How do I say this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.78,0:24:20.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,She isn't doing this half-heartedly. She's putting her all into it just like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.84,0:24:26.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's has a clear passion and vision for the kind of music she wants to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.40,0:24:34.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,"I don't want us to be apart." I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:40.35,Default,host,0,0,0,,I also thought that this might resonate with some of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.35,0:24:43.31,Default,host,0,0,0,,in your own interactions with  your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.08,0:24:55.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,So I really put my heart into Episode 4, and especially for Episode 8,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.84,0:25:01.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,but I realized whenever I talk about Saki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.48,0:25:07.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,I always feel the reason she can enjoy the present so much is because of her past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.88,0:25:10.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,The pain from her past is why she's able to enjoy the "now" so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.58,0:25:16.22,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's is just my personal... interpretation of Saki, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.22,0:25:22.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Maybe it's partially just my own feelings more than Saki's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.60,0:25:27.15,Default,host,0,0,0,,But that said, you can't talk about Saki-chan without her past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.15,0:25:30.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's a huge part of who she is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.20,0:25:34.71,Default,host,0,0,0,,Up until now, I've always seen that past in a positive light.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.71,0:25:44.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,That because of her past, she can enjoy her present so much.
Comment: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:46.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,I always thought that was such a happy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.48,0:25:53.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,But it was also because of that past,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.64,0:25:56.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki-chan's feels the way she does now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.28,0:26:06.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,She had all this pain stirring inside of her but chose not to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:08.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.32,0:26:09.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.92,0:26:19.66,Default,host,0,0,0,,In a completely positive way, she felt like she couldn't tell the rest yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.66,0:26:23.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's hard to explain, but do you get what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:27.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's how I was looking at Saki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.86,0:26:31.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,and so at that moment, I made that realized that's why she might feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.04,0:26:33.51,Default,host,0,0,0,,Just an outsider's perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.84,0:26:37.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,But there was also...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.72,0:26:46.98,Default,host,0,0,0,,also the words Luka-san said to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.98,0:26:58.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,She says these really affirming words, like "I'm sure there were times when those feelings were fulfilled before."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.52,0:27:05.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,I felt a bit comforted by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.40,0:27:11.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki-chan had so many complex feelings about the one-man live,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.64,0:27:20.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,and looking back at her past in Episode 4 really made me feel like that's where a lot of those feelings come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.28,0:27:25.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,I thought Episode 4 might be a painful scene to watch with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.56,0:27:31.30,Default,host,0,0,0,,I was almost in tears myself during the recording session,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.30,0:27:35.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,but I'd like to look back on it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.12,0:27:38.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,Let's watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.54,0:27:39.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Comment: 0,0:27:39.64,0:27:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Story watchalong start
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:42.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.28,0:27:50.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think hearing the word "far" makes her remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.28,0:27:56.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,The loneliness from when she was in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.72,0:28:04.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,She felt that way the whole time back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.65,0:28:17.15,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.16,0:28:21.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Tsukasa-san really acts like he's on his second life, doesn't he?
Comment: 0,0:28:25.52,0:28:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.52,0:28:29.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Fumi-chan, your roommate, is being discharged today.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:31.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.48,0:28:33.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Will you make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.76,0:28:37.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Mom is going to go handle the discharge paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.40,0:28:39.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you on the first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.52,0:28:41.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.72,0:28:43.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could be a little honest with Tsukasa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.21,0:28:45.71,Default,host,0,0,0,,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.57,0:28:49.07,Default,host,0,0,0,,Fumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.72,0:28:53.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Now we can go to school together starting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.96,0:28:57.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we'll be able to do the school festival haunted house together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.99,0:29:01.49,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.24,0:29:04.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Doing a haunted house with everyone... I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.24,0:29:07.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's seeing her off and saying goodbye to the doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.20,0:29:10.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,Let's play together a lot from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.31,0:29:14.81,Default,host,0,0,0,,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.49,0:29:15.99,Default,host,0,0,0,,?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.00,0:29:17.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.44,0:29:19.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Your tests are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.47,0:29:20.97,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.08,0:29:25.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm a little late, but I'm glad I made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.12,0:29:28.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.70,0:29:30.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.20,0:29:30.70,Default,host,0,0,0,,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:32.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,Just this part alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.12,0:29:35.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Seriously, someone please write down how painful these lines are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.13,0:29:39.63,Default,host,0,0,0,,?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.36,0:29:49.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki-chan talked to me so much, and it was always so fun that being in the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.92,0:29:51.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,it didn't feel lonely at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.44,0:29:56.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,So, really, truly...
Comment: 0,0:29:57.09,0:29:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.09,0:29:57.59,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.16,0:30:00.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.52,0:30:02.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.56,0:30:06.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Here, enjoy your school life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.16,0:30:08.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.60,0:30:11.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:17.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Being able to say congratulations here is part of Saki-chan's strength too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.44,0:30:19.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,School starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.24,0:30:22.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.52,0:30:27.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,I don't know what the school festival will be like,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.52,0:30:35.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,but I'm sure it'll be a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.16,0:30:39.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,Don't make a face like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.97,0:30:40.47,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.75,0:30:52.25,Default,host,0,0,0,,Your fever...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.76,0:30:56.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,It looks like it's gone down a bit since this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.60,0:31:03.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,The doctor said if you take your medicine and rest, you'll get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.60,0:31:12.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's quiet. Mom and Dad said they couldn't come today either.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.29,0:31:13.79,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.76,0:31:21.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Have you heard anything from I-chan and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.76,0:31:25.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki-chan, are you watching Tsukasa-chan too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:28.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.32,0:31:30.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's the group chat from my old class.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.56,0:31:38.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's out fruit picking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.44,0:31:44.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,The strawberries look so big and delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.40,0:31:52.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, they sent a message last year saying they wanted to go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.88,0:31:56.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.96,0:31:59.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,the weather is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.56,0:32:05.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's raining here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.68,0:32:10.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Am I the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.08,0:32:14.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,who's going to stay like this forever?
Comment: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:33.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Back then, I couldn't go to school or play with everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.00,0:32:36.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,so when I was alone, I'd start overthinking about what would happen
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.28,0:32:41.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,if everyone drifted away and went somewhere far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.76,0:32:48.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,I was always so scared and lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.36,0:32:54.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,I guess I'm just remembering how I felt back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.93,0:32:56.43,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.60,0:33:04.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,it's strange for me to feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.16,0:33:10.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,I know it's different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.15,0:33:15.65,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.24,0:33:22.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,Even if you know that, it's not strange to feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:30.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because those emotions have been repeated so many times that they've become a part of Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.88,0:33:33.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,A part of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.53,0:33:34.03,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.36,0:33:39.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,So there's no need to reject that part of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.44,0:33:44.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are things you've achieved precisely because you had those feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:48.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Things I've achieved?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.16,0:33:59.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,Like starting Leo/need together, or writing songs that resonate with others by drawing on those experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.00,0:34:06.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,So please, don't think of those feelings as strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.88,0:34:14.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Even if you can't fully process them right now, I don't think there's any need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.84,0:34:16.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,MEIKO...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.12,0:34:22.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.36,0:34:29.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,I might still feel uneasy from time to time,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.72,0:34:39.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,but since that's also a part of me, I want to try accepting it little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.05,0:34:41.55,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.04,0:34:50.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,But if things ever get painful again, please feel free to rely on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.28,0:34:58.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,There might not be much I can do, but I'm always here to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.80,0:35:01.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you, MEIKO.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.76,0:35:09.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.76,0:35:13.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,But why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.36,0:35:21.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,I thought I understood the reason, but I feel like there's still a haze left over.
Comment: 0,0:35:24.56,0:35:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.56,0:35:28.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure you just haven't fully come to terms with it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.36,0:35:33.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,You can't just make those feelings of loneliness disappear easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.57,0:35:35.07,Default,host,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.20,0:35:40.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then we just have to reach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.68,0:35:48.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Like Ichi-chan and the others said, we'll be right there with them through our music!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.31,0:35:51.94,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.94,0:35:52.57,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.60,0:35:54.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.76,0:35:58.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,At tomorrow's solo show, we'll give a performance...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.96,0:36:00.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,that makes sure these feelings reach everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.00,0:36:05.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Comment: 0,0:36:05.08,0:36:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,End watchalong
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.24,0:36:09.34,Default,host,0,0,0,,Alright, that was Episode 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.34,0:36:11.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,What did you all think?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.84,0:36:16.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.04,0:36:20.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,That was quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.72,0:36:27.23,Default,host,0,0,0,,Luka-san's words were so comforting... they really hit home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.08,0:36:33.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,You know, during this recording session for this story,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.48,0:36:46.18,Default,host,0,0,0,,I realized I understand Saki-chan was so much better compared to the first recording sessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.18,0:36:51.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's grown so much through all the story events we've seen to become who she is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.20,0:36:56.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,And seeing Saki-chan through all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.92,0:36:59.35,Default,host,0,0,0,,it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.35,0:37:01.35,Default,host,0,0,0,,Lately, I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.52,0:37:10.38,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much of her voice I'm conveying, and I wonder if my own lack of skill played a part,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.88,0:37:20.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,We see Saki-chan so energetic now, but she also that past trauma,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.68,0:37:25.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,so I found that balance really difficult to strike at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.16,0:37:34.46,Default,host,0,0,0,,Especially in the beginning... in Saki's very first stories, she was cheerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.46,0:37:37.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,but that cheerfulness was a bit forced.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.88,0:37:41.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,That came from a place of restlessness,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.28,0:37:46.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,like she felt she absolutely needed to do all these different things with her friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.92,0:37:49.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,now that she's back with them and they can spend time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.44,0:37:54.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,and she never that chance until recently, so...
Comment: 0,0:37:58.00,0:38:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.00,0:38:05.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,Maybe "unfulfilled" isn't quite the right word, but she's naturally such a kind person,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.00,0:38:08.14,Default,host,0,0,0,,and since she's inherently a cheerful girl, she acts that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.14,0:38:12.06,Default,host,0,0,0,,I felt like there was a bit of an imbalance there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.06,0:38:19.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,This story shows a lot of both Saki-chan's past and present,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.58,0:38:26.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,showing all of the different complex emotions she's experienced up until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.60,0:38:36.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,so I feel like it's the perfect encapsulation of everything she's been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.32,0:38:43.18,Default,host,0,0,0,,Looking back on the whole thing, it reminded me of the kind of person that she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.18,0:38:48.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,while also showing how she's grown and developed these new feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.72,0:38:53.98,Default,host,0,0,0,,So there's a lot of emotions packed in there, but I also felt—
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.98,0:38:55.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:39:01.98,Default,host,0,0,0,,I was able to record my lines without really getting stuck at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.98,0:39:14.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,I understand Saki-chan's feelings so well now that there's no friction when I'm playing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.12,0:39:22.74,Default,host,0,0,0,,I really feel like I understand so many more sides of Saki-chan now than I did when I first started.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.74,0:39:27.26,Default,host,0,0,0,,This may just be how I see it as a voice actress,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.26,0:39:38.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,but I felt like I was truly at one with Saki-chan during the recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.16,0:39:44.42,Default,host,0,0,0,,This was a really impactful story, both for Saki-chan herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.42,0:39:52.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,but also in terms of my own journey understanding all these different sides of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.72,0:40:00.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,Episode 4 in particular had some really painful parts, but as for Saki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.40,0:40:04.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,someone in the chat mentioned it felt like seeing Saki-chan's roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.80,0:40:07.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,I feel like that's a really good way to phrase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.44,0:40:12.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because of those past events, Saki-chan has the mindset she does now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.80,0:40:17.95,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm still not sure how the choice Saki-chan made will change things,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.95,0:40:28.47,Default,host,0,0,0,,or how will affect Leo/need going forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.47,0:40:30.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,I want to treasure this moment for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.08,0:40:37.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,I feel like a time will come where both Saki-chan and I have to face the future of Leoni.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.76,0:40:48.66,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's not exactly a lingering regret, but it made me want to keep facing her with sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.47,0:40:55.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Now that we're looking back on it, it's quite painful, but it's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.12,0:40:56.90,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm so glad Saki could talk with Luka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.90,0:41:03.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful she has someone close by who can help her process her emotions.
Comment: 0,0:41:04.63,0:41:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Comment: 0,0:41:05.80,0:41:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Card Illustrations ===
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.80,0:41:13.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,I've already talked a lot, but let's move to card illustrations now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.52,0:41:20.70,Default,host,0,0,0,,"I could really feel Saki's emotions through the subtle inflections in her voice."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.70,0:41:22.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.92,0:41:31.62,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm so happy that everyone understands it so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.62,0:41:39.42,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's hard to put into words, but I feel like I was really able to connect with Saki-chan on a deeper level.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.42,0:41:46.47,Default,host,0,0,0,,This story feels like the a culmination of the mutual understanding I’ve been building with her.
Comment: 0,0:41:48.40,0:41:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Card Illustrations ===
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.40,0:41:58.45,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,So, before we look at the illustrations in detail, we actually have some comments from the illustration production team.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.45,0:42:00.48,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Let's read through them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.04,0:42:03.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,Regarding the design.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.00,0:42:08.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,As Leo/need grows, they find themselves unable to reach the fans closest to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.32,0:42:15.06,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki realizes she wants to keep playing the same free, intimate music as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.06,0:42:19.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,Their journey so far, where they are now, observing the stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.58,0:42:27.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,We used a traveling adventurer as the motif, with a blue and yellow gradient for Ichika and Honami.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.12,0:42:32.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,The breaking dawn represents the image of Leo/need changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.68,0:42:34.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's such a lovely comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.28,0:42:35.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.28,0:42:42.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,Only Saki doesn't have the gradient; instead, yellow is used on the surface of the cloak covering her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.78,0:42:45.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,This is meant to represent her hiding her true feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.80,0:42:47.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.68,0:42:48.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,We've just got to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.96,0:42:52.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,I want to actually look at the illustrations now while we talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.86,0:42:54.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,Aren't they just gorgeous?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.84,0:42:56.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,They really are incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.32,0:43:03.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,I was just talking with the staff about how they look like they're from a movie or a picture book.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.78,0:43:06.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,And look, her hair is short!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.20,0:43:09.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.25,0:43:10.75,Default,host,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Comment: 0,0:43:12.36,0:43:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.36,0:43:13.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.11,0:43:14.61,Default,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.32,0:43:16.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.45,0:43:17.95,Default,host,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.60,0:43:31.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,this outfit and the background too... it has this watercolor-like touch to it. She looks like an adventurer who's traveled to observe the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.76,0:43:35.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,The outfit definitely gives off a traveler vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.28,0:43:38.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.80,0:43:39.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.32,0:43:43.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,But she has such a sorrowful expression, with those troubled eyebrows...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.20,0:43:47.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,They're kind of slanted downward,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.48,0:43:49.30,Default,host,0,0,0,,aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.30,0:43:51.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,And here's the trained version.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.72,0:43:53.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.54,0:43:59.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Look at that expression she's making...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.04,0:43:59.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.31,0:44:01.81,Default,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.04,0:44:06.34,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's hearts must be tightening right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.34,0:44:07.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,The illustration is gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.31,0:44:09.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.86,0:44:10.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Her mouth... oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.68,0:44:15.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,is her mouth being hidden part of the meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.85,0:44:18.35,Default,host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.17,0:44:19.67,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.16,0:44:21.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're totally right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.35,0:44:23.85,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.24,0:44:26.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,So that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.44,0:44:27.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.72,0:44:30.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.52,0:44:32.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for pointing that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.60,0:44:35.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,And next is Ichi...
Comment: 0,0:44:37.04,0:44:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.04,0:44:37.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.31,0:44:38.81,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.28,0:44:43.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Look, Ichi-chan's hair is short in this one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.20,0:44:45.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,I really like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.64,0:44:49.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,She has this sort of ennui-filled smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.08,0:44:52.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,And the background is so cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.12,0:44:52.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.40,0:44:57.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'd love to travel through a world like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.84,0:45:00.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hehe, it's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.12,0:45:05.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,Ichi-chan's outfit here is also amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.20,0:45:09.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,The level of detail they put into it is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.64,0:45:13.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,The short hair looks great on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.92,0:45:19.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,And Honami-chan has such a great expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.51,0:45:21.01,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.52,0:45:22.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's even got sweat dripping down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.24,0:45:27.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,Her gaze is so direct and wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.24,0:45:29.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.04,0:45:29.65,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.65,0:45:33.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,You know how she gets offers for voice acting work?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.15,0:45:34.65,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.52,0:45:39.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,What do you think of this clear, refreshing vibe?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.72,0:45:42.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's our Ichika for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.08,0:45:43.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.36,0:45:46.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,The microphone really suits her!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.78,0:45:47.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's such a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.28,0:45:49.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.20,0:45:51.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,They even included the sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.88,0:45:53.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're totally right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.24,0:45:56.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,Someone in the chat wrote, "A beautiful woman dripping with sweat."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.12,0:46:00.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,And... oh, sorry.
Comment: 0,0:46:00.24,0:46:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.24,0:46:00.95,Default,host,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.89,0:46:03.39,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.04,0:46:05.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hona-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.12,0:46:08.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.76,0:46:10.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.24,0:46:15.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,This, um, is it a cape?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.68,0:46:17.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.40,0:46:20.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Or should I call it a skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.68,0:46:27.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,The detail on the hem is just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.84,0:46:31.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,And look at that gorgeous profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.64,0:46:33.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.76,0:46:37.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,If you look closely,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.76,0:46:45.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,there's a gradation with stars, and how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.48,0:46:48.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Even the inside of the cape is decorated so beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.40,0:46:50.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.27,0:46:52.77,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.36,0:46:55.66,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's like a tarot card.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.66,0:46:56.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.07,0:46:59.62,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.62,0:47:01.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,So mature and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.16,0:47:03.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki too...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.20,0:47:04.62,Default,host,0,0,0,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.62,0:47:05.35,Default,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.20,0:47:07.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki is so cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.36,0:47:11.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,That side angle is so pretty, I'm just staring at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.16,0:47:12.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,I totally agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.64,0:47:15.09,Default,host,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.09,0:47:15.65,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.17,0:47:17.67,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.24,0:47:21.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's just overflowing with motherly vibes.
Comment: 0,0:47:22.56,0:47:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.56,0:47:23.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hona...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.44,0:47:25.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.63,0:47:28.13,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.52,0:47:32.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,The tarot cards, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.54,0:47:34.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,they're called the AIU pattern tarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.28,0:47:38.53,Default,host,0,0,0,,Her mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.53,0:47:39.13,Default,host,0,0,0,,Shiba...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.20,0:47:41.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,Shiba-o is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.44,0:47:45.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.00,0:47:46.06,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's just so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.06,0:47:47.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so soothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.56,0:47:49.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,So peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.29,0:47:50.79,Default,host,0,0,0,,So peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.92,0:47:56.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,And I absolutely love this illustration too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.91,0:47:58.41,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.64,0:48:01.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.92,0:48:04.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,Isn't it just incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.58,0:48:08.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,And look at the star she's holding in her hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.05,0:48:10.55,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.23,0:48:12.97,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.97,0:48:13.71,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.68,0:48:16.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.40,0:48:21.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's really just too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.12,0:48:26.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everything is so perfect that I can't even explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.00,0:48:30.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,I just want to say thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.12,0:48:33.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's too wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.28,0:48:40.82,Default,host,0,0,0,,The way her hair flows, the background, and how she's holding...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.82,0:48:44.62,Default,host,0,0,0,,she's holding everyone's stars, and the outfit suits her so well,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.62,0:48:47.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,and that expression... I could go on forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.92,0:48:48.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,it's seriously everything.
Comment: 0,0:48:50.88,0:48:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.88,0:48:52.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everything is just too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.12,0:48:53.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.59,0:48:55.09,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.08,0:48:57.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,It really feels like they're watching over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.22,0:48:58.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.72,0:49:01.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.55,0:49:03.05,Default,host,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.87,0:49:05.37,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.44,0:49:11.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,I touched on this during the story earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.19,0:49:13.69,Default,host,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.72,0:49:17.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,everyone, she's saying that quote with this expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.39,0:49:19.89,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.20,0:49:22.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.04,0:49:25.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,This illustration hits even harder after seeing that scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.76,0:49:28.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,I really love this expression she's making.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.72,0:49:31.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Rurika...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.76,0:49:35.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm just so grateful that you're here, that you exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.43,0:49:36.93,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.48,0:49:39.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,And finally, we have Shiho-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.76,0:49:40.70,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.70,0:49:42.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,This is what the outfits look like this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.86,0:49:46.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're right, Saki-chan's cape is...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.52,0:50:02.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's yellow, but everyone's has a gradient. They designed it to look like the dawn, symbolizing how Leoni is changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.03,0:50:03.53,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.12,0:50:04.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.48,0:50:08.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,I want to take a closer look at the outfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.52,0:50:11.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Since they're adventurers, they're even carrying maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.48,0:50:13.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.16,0:50:14.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.64,0:50:19.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,We've looked at a lot, and it was all so good.
Comment: 0,0:50:20.96,0:50:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.96,0:50:30.06,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,And now, we have the song that Kuriyama Yuri wrote specifically for this event,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.06,0:50:33.88,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,"Hanamusubi". My pronunciation was actually pretty good there!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.88,0:50:34.55,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Wait, I mean the 2D MV.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.68,0:50:43.48,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,The 2D MV was just released a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.48,0:50:44.92,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,It really was just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.68,0:50:48.08,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,It hasn't even been an hour yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.04,0:50:54.94,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Since it's out, I'd like for us to watch it together and talk about the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.94,0:50:58.45,Default,host,0,0,0,,First, let's take a look at the 2D MV.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.45,0:50:59.09,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.28,0:51:09.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Finding the conclusion I'd waited for since the start, in this night.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.12,0:51:27.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hurriedly hiding it, acting like I didn't know, enduring the pain of a forced smile, feeling the tightness of a love shaped to fit others, unable to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.04,0:51:29.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.63,0:51:30.13,Default,host,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.84,0:51:36.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,Feeling like everything would crumble, I kept my lips sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.57,0:51:38.07,Default,host,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.28,0:51:40.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,No matter what, speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.56,0:51:45.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Please, unravel this heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.87,0:51:47.37,Default,host,0,0,0,,Unchanging.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.84,0:51:51.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Pinning back my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.84,0:52:06.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,Connecting the threads of fate, becoming a flower tied together, seeking a sliver of hope, in the gaps of an unchanging tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.76,0:52:12.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,I realized the true hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.00,0:52:34.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,We just watched "Hanamusubi", and that 2D MV is just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.04,0:52:35.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.00,0:52:47.06,Default,host,0,0,0,,Since Kuriyama-san wrote this song for us, I'd like to talk a bit about the recording session.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.06,0:52:59.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,During recording, we usually get an explanation beforehand about the story and what kind of song it's going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.78,0:53:05.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,When I heard the explanation and saw the song before the recording,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.96,0:53:13.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,I could really feel how much they took this story and Saki's feelings into account while writing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.88,0:53:20.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's a song where that really comes across.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.76,0:53:30.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,You can definitely feel Kuriyama-san's unique musical style and touch in it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.24,0:53:35.42,Default,host,0,0,0,,Kuriyama-san also left a comment about it on the official broadcast.
Comment: 0,0:53:35.42,0:53:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.42,0:53:44.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,I feel like the comments we received showed they really understood our intent for Leo/need's future when making this,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.54,0:53:48.18,Default,host,0,0,0,,so it made me feel like we weren't going in the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.18,0:53:55.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm savoring every single lyric. It's like Saki-chan's emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.28,0:54:06.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,were gathered up and processed into this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.92,0:54:14.50,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so bittersweet... the chorus is really high-pitched, which almost makes it feel like she's losing her composure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.50,0:54:19.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so delicate, how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.12,0:54:21.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,Like she's overwhelmed and sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.72,0:54:27.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Having the chorus go so high in this flow makes it feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.04,0:54:40.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,it's not just sadness or impatience, but a beautiful, delicate expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.16,0:54:53.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,Listening to it again, everyone's voices blending together is just so good. Not to toot our own horns, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.48,0:54:57.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's just so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.44,0:55:01.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,Even their expressions are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.76,0:55:02.43,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.95,0:55:04.45,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.28,0:55:07.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm just staring at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.28,0:55:10.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's good no matter how many times I watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.55,0:55:12.05,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.72,0:55:16.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,I hope you all watch it many times too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.52,0:55:31.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Please listen to "Hanamusubi" again after experiencing this story. I think your thoughts and interpretations will really expand,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.20,0:55:34.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,and you'll start wondering what's going to happen to Leo/need from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.88,0:55:37.30,Default,host,0,0,0,,I can really feel that through this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.30,0:55:42.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,It feels a bit ominous, or like something to worry about...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.40,0:55:44.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,I can sense that in the music too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.32,0:55:51.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,I honestly don't know what's coming next either,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.88,0:55:59.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,so I want to savor Leo/need through this song, just like all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.00,0:55:59.50,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.40,0:56:01.02,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.02,0:56:06.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,This MV is uploaded to the official ProSeka YouTube channel,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.40,0:56:08.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,so please go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.00,0:56:14.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,And with that, our time is almost up. This has been ProSeka After...
Comment: 0,0:56:14.84,0:56:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.84,0:56:20.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,That concludes the "Stars Twinkle in the Night Sky We Look Up At" edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.54,0:56:24.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,To everyone watching the stream, how did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.84,0:56:29.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're all leaving so many wonderful comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.04,0:56:29.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.80,0:56:36.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,Someone said, "Saki-chan's pained delivery before the chorus was so good."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.40,0:56:37.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.55,0:56:40.05,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.04,0:56:47.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,Usually Icchan records first, and she's just so...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.36,0:56:58.02,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's such an incredible singer, her performance is already so complete. I think everyone uses that as a baseline,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.02,0:57:03.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,or rather, as a guide for how we should approach our own recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.08,0:57:11.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think that's how it usually goes, but this time, partly due to the song's atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.28,0:57:17.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,I really prioritized putting Saki-chan's emotions into the performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.24,0:57:23.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to hear that the sadness and everything really reached you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.63,0:57:25.13,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.88,0:57:30.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,Someone said, "I'm glad you talked about so many things" and "It was great to hear your stories."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.32,0:57:31.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.58,0:57:32.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Such kind comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.31,0:57:35.02,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.02,0:57:40.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,I always say this, but I really love these AfterTalks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.28,0:57:40.95,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.56,0:57:51.46,Default,host,0,0,0,,Recording is usually a solo process, even though I know you're all supporting me,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.46,0:58:00.02,Default,host,0,0,0,,but during AfterTalk, I get to share all these feelings with everyone as a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.02,0:58:10.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Not just as a performer, but as a viewer myself, I can cheer on Saki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.20,0:58:15.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,and cheer on Leo/need... talking about how painful this was, or how much they've grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.32,0:58:23.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,I love having this time to talk about everything. It went by so fast, I might have talked too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.08,0:58:28.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,but even though it was a bit of a sad story, it's become a very important
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.72,0:58:36.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,event story to me. I'm so grateful for this time to look back on it with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.24,0:58:39.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for joining me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.88,0:58:45.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're all wondering what's going to happen from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.28,0:58:51.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,but there's no doubt that the members of Leo/need all care deeply for one another.
Comment: 0,0:58:52.24,0:58:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.24,0:58:56.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone cares about each other so much, they're all such good kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.04,0:59:10.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think because they're able to face each other properly, their emotions will probably grow and evolve in many ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.44,0:59:17.26,Default,host,0,0,0,,I don't know anything for sure yet, so this is just my own personal take on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.26,0:59:20.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,But I'm really looking forward to watching over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.96,0:59:26.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'd be so happy if you'd continue to watch over Leo/need and Saki-chan along with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.12,0:59:28.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.28,0:59:36.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,By the way, if you haven't finished the story for "Twinkling Stars in the Night Sky" yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.72,0:59:43.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,you can read it all in the Event Stories menu once the next event starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.48,0:59:44.90,Default,host,0,0,0,,Please go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.90,0:59:46.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,You can read it as many times as you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.25,0:59:47.95,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.95,0:59:50.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,And with that, it's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.80,0:59:55.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,I always worry if I've forgotten to say something, but I think I've talked quite a lot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.24,1:00:00.42,Default,host,0,0,0,,I really hope my feelings reached all of you, even just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.42,1:00:04.10,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for staying with me until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.10,1:00:06.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,See you again next time!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.51,1:00:08.25,Default,host,0,0,0,,Bye
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.25,1:00:08.99,Default,host,0,0,0,,bye!
